            "target_entity_instance": "Drought",
            "target_entity_type": "NaturalHazardType",
            "paragraph": "Drought is the most frequent, complex, chronic, and severe natural disaster worldwide1-3. Drought areas caused by water deficits have significantly spread in the past several decades across China because of climate change 4,5.",
