            "paragraph": "The multi-year trend of ATDD also shows that the drought duration at some stations in the southwest, southeast, and northeast regions of China had significantly reduced, while the drought duration at some stations in central and southwestern regions had increased significantly (Fig. 7b).",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
